        {
            "+content": "Faye Leonheart is a seventeen-year-old swordfighting prodigy and the heir apparent to the mightiest warrior clan. After three long years, she finally returns from her sword-training pilgrimage…with a magical machine gun in hand. Promptly disowned by her family with nothing but her beloved firearm for company, this trigger-happy young lady commits herself to studying ancient technology called overgear. The world is full of archaic ruins, and Faye is ready to explore them, full-metal style. <em class=de-emphasized>(from manga light novel)</em>",
